{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of Odyssey Times, a retro-inspired JRPG that combines the charm of classic SNES-era games with a modern twist. Crafted with love for games like Final Fantasy and Undertale, this game takes you on an epic journey filled with emotion and strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Story-Driven Adventure</i><br>In Odyssey Times, you\u2019ll embark on a captivating quest filled with rich characters, mysterious lands, and dark forces threatening the world. This game attempts to capture the spirit of the 16-bit JRPGs you know and love - while adding fresh mechanics that push the genre forward. Battle enemies with a dynamic combat system, explore beautifully crafted pixel landscapes, and solve puzzles as you unravel the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stunning Pixel Art and Soundtrack</i><br>Immerse yourself in the handcrafted pixel art that calls back to the golden age of RPGs by AAA and PixelBoy.<br>Complementing the visuals is an epic soundtrack carrying you through the highs and lows of your journey made by Haberchuck.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2923000?t=1769773910","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769773910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923000/2c52007e3ccc954b77db94ba92057b3b41648da8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769773910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923000/2c52007e3ccc954b77db94ba92057b3b41648da8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769773910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description